      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$1 = \\dfrac{10}{10}$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{1 \\times 5}{2 \\times 5} = \\dfrac{5}{10}$ .",
          "ما أُخذ : $\\dfrac{3}{10} + \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{3 + 5}{10} = \\dfrac{8}{10}$ .",
